Depends: debian-archive-keyring
Replaces: citos-sources (<< 0.1.2~)
Breaks: citos-sources (<< 0.1.2~)
Description: CybroidOS package sources (deb.cybroid.com)
 Points apt at deb.cybroid.com, which serves Debian 13's archive (and its
 security updates) under the CybroidOS name, and CybroidOS's own packages.
 Debian's packages are checked against Debian's signing keys, CybroidOS's
 against the CybroidOS archive key (shipped here); CybroidOS's updates install
 by themselves, as Debian's security updates do. Debian's own source entries are set
 aside, not deleted, and come back if this package is removed.
